WEBVTT

01:30.000 --> 01:33.400
Ouyang Xiaotian, come out!

01:34.000 --> 01:37.000
Darn it!
Come out!

01:37.000 --> 01:38.000
Ouyang Xiaotian!

01:39.000 --> 01:40.000
Come out now!

01:52.800 --> 01:54.800
What's so funny?
Show yourself!

02:01.000 --> 02:06.600
Want to know why? You'll know
everything when you breathe your last

02:08.000 --> 02:14.000
Seems to us you've turned into a demon.
Evil and good can never co-exist

02:14.000 --> 02:18.000
We're here today to settle
all our scores

02:18.000 --> 02:22.000
Fine. Meet your doom!

04:47.000 --> 04:49.800
I'll get rid of the poison for you!

04:50.000 --> 04:53.800
Leave me alone!
I don't need you to save me!

04:55.000 --> 05:00.000
I'm not going to kill you! Heaven is
merciful. Besides, we're friends!

05:00.600 --> 05:02.600
Do you hear me?
We're friends!

05:02.600 --> 05:04.000
Let me be!

05:11.000 --> 05:12.400
Kill him!

05:13.000 --> 05:19.000
No! It's my duty to save lives.
I'll be able to save him! Trust me!

05:19.000 --> 05:21.000
Pin him down

05:53.000 --> 05:55.000
-Hurry! Is it ready?
-Coming...

05:55.000 --> 05:56.800
Cut it up

05:59.000 --> 06:01.000
Quick!

06:04.000 --> 06:06.000
-Careful!
-It's hot!

06:10.000 --> 06:12.000
He's come to

06:12.000 --> 06:14.000
Lu, pour it out

06:17.000 --> 06:18.600
Feel better?

06:21.000 --> 06:24.000
You'll be all right
after taking this medicine

06:26.600 --> 06:28.600
Why won't you take it?

06:28.600 --> 06:30.600
Why didn't you kill me?

06:30.600 --> 06:34.600
I told you - Heaven is merciful.
Besides, we're friends, and I'm a doctor

06:34.600 --> 06:36.600
It's my duty to save you.
Here

06:37.000 --> 06:40.600
I won't be grateful to you.
I might even kill you!

06:41.000 --> 06:46.000
You can't do that unless you
regain your health and energy, right?

06:46.000 --> 06:50.600
Exactly. Given the state you're in,
do you think you can kill us? No way

06:50.600 --> 06:54.600
I'll leave the medicine here.
It's up to you to take it

06:54.600 --> 06:56.600
Let's leave him alone

06:57.000 --> 06:59.000
The medicine is right here

07:00.600 --> 07:01.600
Take it

07:17.000 --> 07:20.000
Long live Your Majesty!

07:21.000 --> 07:24.000
-Please rise
-Thank you, Your Majesty

07:25.000 --> 07:30.000
Wei Delu, Wu Fuqi and Mei Shouquan
saved our country from a disaster

07:30.000 --> 07:34.000
I hereby appoint them as
Divine Generals!

07:34.800 --> 07:36.800
Thank you, Your Majesty!

07:37.000 --> 07:41.600
We've been plagued by both natural and
man-made disasters in recent years

07:41.600 --> 07:46.800
So make sure you do a good job.
Your responsibilities are heavy

07:47.000 --> 07:51.000
We will bear Your Majesty's words
in mind

07:53.000 --> 07:57.000
The mortals are plagued by disasters
because the Three Lucky Stars...

07:57.000 --> 07:59.000
are not shining on them

07:59.000 --> 08:01.600
Things will be different from now on

08:03.880 --> 08:04.880
What is it?

08:21.000 --> 08:24.000
What wish did Your Highness make?

08:25.000 --> 08:29.800
You're now one of the Divine Generals.
It's time you displayed your talent

08:31.000 --> 08:34.000
I hope we'll have a bright future

08:41.000 --> 08:43.000
Let me ask you, Your Highness

08:45.000 --> 08:51.000
If I disappear just like a shooting star
one day, what will you do?

08:53.000 --> 08:56.000
Why would that happen?
Where will you go?

08:58.000 --> 09:01.600
I'll be frank with you.
I'm not a mortal

09:03.000 --> 09:08.000
I'm actually the Prosperity Star who's
come down to the mortal world to suffer

09:09.000 --> 09:13.000
One of these days,
I'll have to return to Heaven

09:14.000 --> 09:18.600
I don't believe you. How could you
deceive me with such a story?

09:24.000 --> 09:27.800
Why would I deceive you,
Your Highness?

09:29.000 --> 09:31.000
I just don't want to hurt you

09:32.800 --> 09:34.800
I will leave sooner or later

09:36.000 --> 09:38.000
I don't care what reason you have

09:42.000 --> 09:45.000
Just tell me - will you marry me?

09:47.000 --> 09:49.000
What do you think of this fabric?

09:50.000 --> 09:52.000
Have a look.
Why won't you say anything?

09:53.000 --> 09:58.600
I've kept it for many years.
You can use it as a quilt cover

09:58.600 --> 10:00.600
Whatever for?

10:00.600 --> 10:05.000
Don't you know newly-weds
must have a new quilt?

10:05.600 --> 10:09.000
-Who's getting married?
-You and Wu Fuqi

10:11.000 --> 10:14.000
Didn't you use to dislike him?

10:14.000 --> 10:19.000
Well, he used to be
a good-for-nothing and a gambler

10:19.000 --> 10:22.000
But now, he's a general.
Things are different

10:22.000 --> 10:25.000
What has that got to do with me?

10:25.000 --> 10:29.000
He already said he didn't want me

10:29.000 --> 10:31.000
Who said anything to that effect?

10:31.000 --> 10:35.000
General!
Speak of the devil!

10:35.000 --> 10:39.600
-These are for you
-You shouldn't have gone to the expense

10:44.000 --> 10:45.000
Shuangxi...

10:50.000 --> 10:54.000
She's still angry with you
for posing as an immortal

10:54.000 --> 10:57.000
Go and appease her.
You have my support

10:58.000 --> 11:03.000
Have a discussion to
fix a date for your wedding

11:03.000 --> 11:05.000
I'll get on with my chores

11:12.600 --> 11:17.000
Sis asked us to fix a date
for our wedding...

11:17.000 --> 11:19.000
I'm not going to marry you

11:21.000 --> 11:23.800
Shuangxi...

11:34.000 --> 11:36.600
Don't be angry, Shuangxi

11:37.000 --> 11:39.000
I can explain everything

11:41.000 --> 11:44.000
Don't be so fierce.
Simmer down

11:48.000 --> 11:51.000
Remember the fortune bag you gave me?

11:53.000 --> 11:54.000
Look!

11:55.000 --> 11:58.000
You're having me on again.
The bag wasn't so big

11:58.600 --> 12:00.600
It is this big!

12:02.000 --> 12:06.600
My biggest fortune is to
make you my wife

12:07.000 --> 12:09.000
Who's going to marry you?

12:09.000 --> 12:12.000
-Come on, Shuangxi...
-Let go!

12:12.000 --> 12:14.800
Marry me!

12:15.000 --> 12:19.000
Marry me!
I can't do without you!

12:20.880 --> 12:22.000
You mean it?

12:22.000 --> 12:25.600
Why would I lie to you?
I must make you my wife

12:27.000 --> 12:29.000
How about the eighth day
of the eighth month?

12:31.000 --> 12:33.000
What about it?

12:33.000 --> 12:35.000
You just said you'd marry me!

12:35.000 --> 12:37.800
-The Eighth day of the eighth month?
-Well?

12:39.000 --> 12:41.600
-I'm afraid...
-Of what?

12:42.000 --> 12:47.000
Shou said if we can't return to
the Celestial Court before we turn 30,

12:47.000 --> 12:50.000
disaster will befall us...

12:50.000 --> 12:53.600
You still think
you're the Fortune Star?

12:54.000 --> 12:57.000
How could you lie to me
time and again! You're too much!

12:59.000 --> 13:00.000
Shuangxi!

13:15.000 --> 13:17.800
Deity of Marriage!
What are you doing?

13:18.600 --> 13:22.600
Zhang!
What brings you over today?

13:23.000 --> 13:25.600
Long time no see.
Let's have a drink

13:26.000 --> 13:28.000
You're treating me to a drink?

13:28.000 --> 13:31.000
See, I've brought my gourd

13:33.000 --> 13:35.600
Please don't get me into trouble

13:36.000 --> 13:39.600
When I get drunk,
I tend to tie the wrong knots

13:39.600 --> 13:43.000
I've received many complaints.
I mustn't make any more mistakes

13:44.000 --> 13:48.600
So you're aware of it. Why did you still
propose marriage as Ma-gu's father then?

13:48.600 --> 13:50.600
Weren't you bold!

13:51.000 --> 13:53.000
Don't spread news around

13:53.000 --> 13:54.600
What should be done?

13:54.600 --> 13:59.000
They've fallen in love. Even I can't
do anything, let alone you

13:59.000 --> 14:01.600
Now I'm different from you

14:02.000 --> 14:05.000
It's not too late to make amends

14:05.000 --> 14:09.000
Quickly cut off the string that ties
Wei Delu to Princess Ruining,

14:09.000 --> 14:13.000
and the string that ties
Wu Fuqi to Yu Shuangxi,

14:13.000 --> 14:16.000
so they won't be in agony
like Mei Shouquan and Ma-gu

14:16.000 --> 14:20.800
Aren't you cruel to want to
break up three loving couples

14:20.800 --> 14:25.000
Why in the world did the Jade Emperor
put you in charge of marriages?

14:25.000 --> 14:29.000
Every mortal who falls in love
is blinded by it

14:29.000 --> 14:35.000
The Trio are supposed to attain immor-
tality. How could they fall in love?

14:35.000 --> 14:37.000
Where are the strings
that tie them together?

14:37.000 --> 14:40.000
-Don't make a mess of my strings...
-Find theirs, quick!

14:42.000 --> 14:45.600
-Don't rush me. I'll do it myself...
-Be quick!

14:50.000 --> 14:52.000
I kind of sympathize with them

14:52.000 --> 14:58.000
Mei Shouquan and Ma-gu were planning
to do something for the people

14:59.000 --> 15:03.600
But now they've been torn apart.
One is in Heaven, and the other, on Earth

15:04.000 --> 15:06.000
I feel so bad

15:07.000 --> 15:11.000
But then if the Trio
can't return to Heaven,

15:11.000 --> 15:14.800
the mortals will suffer even more

15:15.000 --> 15:20.000
Once they return to Heaven, they'll
have to part with their loved ones

15:20.000 --> 15:22.600
What a knotty problem!

15:23.000 --> 15:28.800
When I think of that,
I feel I'm not fit to be an immortal

15:29.000 --> 15:34.000
I must ask the Jade Emperor for early
retirement one day and go back home

15:35.000 --> 15:37.600
How come I just can't find them...?

15:37.600 --> 15:39.000
How can it be?

15:41.000 --> 15:43.000
Maybe it's Heaven's will

15:43.000 --> 15:45.400
Indeed!
Find the strings, quick!

15:46.000 --> 15:48.000
Bad news!

15:48.000 --> 15:51.000
Ouyang Xiaotian has been beaten
by the Trio!

15:51.600 --> 15:55.600
What!
What a good-for-nothing he is!

15:56.000 --> 15:59.000
I bet he didn't do his best!

15:59.600 --> 16:01.600
Are you disappointed, Master?

16:03.000 --> 16:07.000
If only he'd won!
I'd have been able to eat the Trio up

16:07.000 --> 16:11.000
I'd have existed as long as Heaven
and be on a par with the Jade Emperor

16:11.000 --> 16:14.800
There's such an advantage
for eating the Trio?

16:15.000 --> 16:18.000
Bring him here.
I'll feed him to the Spider!

16:18.000 --> 16:19.600
What!

16:32.000 --> 16:34.000
I feel so sorry for him

16:34.000 --> 16:37.000
He's been stripped of all his skills

16:38.000 --> 16:42.800
-Go and capture him
-No. You go. He's too pitiful

16:42.800 --> 16:45.800
If neither of us will go,
who's going to capture him?

16:47.000 --> 16:49.600
We'll do it together

17:32.000 --> 17:34.600
Xiaotian!

17:36.800 --> 17:42.800
Where are you going?
There's nowhere you can go now

17:43.000 --> 17:47.600
You're right.
I brought this upon myself

17:48.000 --> 17:50.600
I don't need anybody's help

17:51.000 --> 17:56.800
Don't be so stubborn. Turn back.
It's the only way out for you

17:56.800 --> 17:58.800
I don't need any sympathy!

18:02.000 --> 18:04.600
It's no longer possible for us

18:06.000 --> 18:08.000
I wish you and Wei Delu all the best

18:08.000 --> 18:10.000
I'm showing concern for a friend!

18:13.000 --> 18:17.000
Thanks.
I may not know where I should go,

18:18.000 --> 18:20.000
but I know where I should head

18:21.600 --> 18:23.600
I don't need your concern!

18:39.000 --> 18:42.600
-I feel so sorry for him...
-Seize him before it's too late!

18:43.000 --> 18:45.000
I can't bring myself to do it!

18:45.000 --> 18:48.600
It's better for him than for us
to be fed to the Spider

18:49.000 --> 18:52.000
We won't be in Master's
good books forever

18:52.000 --> 18:55.000
I'm afraid we might end up like him

18:55.000 --> 19:00.000
I know. Once we outlive our usefulness,
Master will treat us the same way

19:01.000 --> 19:04.000
What are we going to do...?

19:06.800 --> 19:07.800
Got it!

19:16.000 --> 19:18.600
Where are you, Ruyi?

19:24.000 --> 19:30.600
Where on earth are you?
Can you hear me calling you?

19:32.000 --> 19:33.000
Ruyi!

19:34.600 --> 19:38.600
I miss you, Ruyi.
I really miss you

19:41.000 --> 19:44.600
Ruyi, where are you?

19:47.000 --> 19:48.000
Ruyi...

19:52.000 --> 19:57.000
How I wish I'd turn into an immortal
right away. I'd be able to see you then

20:00.000 --> 20:05.000
Ruyi, I may live in this world,

20:05.000 --> 20:08.000
but I don't feel blessed at all

20:08.600 --> 20:11.600
In fact, I feel
Heaven is torturing me

20:12.600 --> 20:14.600
Can you hear me?

20:16.800 --> 20:19.800
Ruyi, can you hear me?

20:22.000 --> 20:25.000
Ruyi, can you hear me?

20:30.000 --> 20:35.000
To think Longevity has become
an affectionate man in the mortal world

20:35.600 --> 20:40.000
Exactly. I wonder what caused
the change in him

20:42.000 --> 20:46.800
I've finally seen the power of love

20:47.000 --> 20:51.600
All along, I thought
only money could make one yield

20:52.000 --> 20:54.000
But look at him

20:55.000 --> 20:57.000
Why don't we help him?

20:59.000 --> 21:00.000
Help him?

21:00.000 --> 21:04.000
Ruyi, can you hear me?
Please answer me!

21:05.000 --> 21:07.000
Where are you?

21:10.000 --> 21:13.000
Ruyi!

21:14.000 --> 21:16.000
Answer me!

21:18.000 --> 21:21.000
You can't just give me
the cold shoulder!

21:33.000 --> 21:34.000
Ruyi!

21:37.000 --> 21:42.000
Ruyi, please answer me.
Don't give me the cold shoulder

21:43.000 --> 21:45.000
I really miss you...

21:47.000 --> 21:48.000
Ruyi...

21:48.000 --> 21:49.000
Longie!

21:50.000 --> 21:51.000
Who is it?

21:51.800 --> 21:53.800
-Longie!
-Who is it?

21:53.800 --> 21:55.800
I'm behind you

21:58.000 --> 22:04.000
Your face is so white, and yours,
so red! Are you lobsters or humans?

22:04.000 --> 22:07.000
We're immortals

22:07.000 --> 22:08.000
Immortals?

22:08.000 --> 22:13.000
No wonder you don't recognize us. A day
in Heaven is a few hundred years on earth

22:13.000 --> 22:16.000
I'm God of Wealth,
and he, God of Kitchen

22:17.000 --> 22:20.000
All three of us
serve the Jade Emperor

22:20.800 --> 22:23.800
Really? You're God of Kitchen,
and you, God of Wealth?

22:24.000 --> 22:26.000
Let me offer you a drink then

22:27.000 --> 22:30.000
Don't pour the wine away...

22:31.000 --> 22:33.000
-Is it enough?
-Yes...

22:34.000 --> 22:38.000
-Do you want to see Ma-gu?
-I miss her so much

22:38.000 --> 22:40.000
Shall we take you to her?

22:41.000 --> 22:43.000
Do you mean what you said?

22:43.000 --> 22:47.000
It's all because of us
she's being locked up

22:47.000 --> 22:49.000
She's being locked up?

22:49.000 --> 22:52.600
The Deity of Plague made use of us.
Do give us a chance to make amends!

22:53.000 --> 22:56.800
Sure.
Take me to her at once!

22:56.800 --> 22:58.800
-Any more wine?
-There's a little left

22:58.800 --> 23:00.800
I'll keep it for you

23:29.000 --> 23:31.000
She's inside

23:33.800 --> 23:35.800
-Ruyi!
-Shou!

23:37.000 --> 23:39.000
-Shou!
-Ruyi!

23:42.000 --> 23:44.000
What happened?
Why can't I get in?

23:44.000 --> 23:46.000
This is the most we can do

23:46.000 --> 23:48.000
We'll keep watch for you outside

23:54.880 --> 23:55.880
Ruyi...

23:59.000 --> 24:02.600
-How are you, Shou?
-I'm fine

24:04.000 --> 24:06.000
You've lost weight

24:11.000 --> 24:15.000
Why did you come here? Go.
I don't want to get you into trouble

24:16.000 --> 24:19.800
I'm not afraid
so long as I can see you

24:21.000 --> 24:23.000
I have so many things to say to you

24:24.000 --> 24:26.000
I missed you so much

24:28.000 --> 24:30.000
Things in the mortal world
are getting better

24:31.800 --> 24:33.800
But my heart sinks day by day

24:34.000 --> 24:36.000
Don't lose heart

24:36.000 --> 24:40.000
When good fortune is boundless as
the seas, and longevity is comparable...

24:40.000 --> 24:43.000
to the mountains,
you'll be able to return to Heaven

24:45.000 --> 24:51.000
I really don't know
what kind of phenomenon that is

24:52.000 --> 24:54.000
How will I make it happen?

24:55.000 --> 25:01.000
I really can't think
what kind of phenomenon it is like

25:05.000 --> 25:07.000
I really don't know...

25:09.800 --> 25:14.400
Never mind about that.
I'll get you out first

25:17.000 --> 25:18.600
No, Shou!

25:21.000 --> 25:22.000
Shou!

25:25.000 --> 25:27.000
Leave!
Don't bother about me!

25:35.000 --> 25:37.000
No, Shou!
Just go!

25:43.000 --> 25:44.000
Shou!

25:51.000 --> 25:52.000
Shou!

26:08.000 --> 26:11.000
How foolish of you.
I don't want you to get hurt

26:13.000 --> 26:18.000
I'm willing to pay any price
to get you out

26:21.000 --> 26:23.000
Let's get out of here

26:25.000 --> 26:30.000
"The top scholar, Wei Delu,
is a rare talent"

26:30.000 --> 26:33.000
"I hereby make him Prince Consort"

26:33.000 --> 26:37.600
May you and Princess Ruining
be a loving couple and...

26:37.600 --> 26:40.600
live in bliss all your lives

26:41.000 --> 26:45.000
Congratulations to Her Highness
and Prince Consort!

26:46.000 --> 26:49.000
Congratulations

26:53.000 --> 26:57.000
Wait, Father! Pardon me for being rude.
I object to the arrangement

27:04.000 --> 27:07.000
What's going on?
You're confusing me!

27:22.000 --> 27:27.000
Fuqi Armed Escort Agency
is now officially open!

27:31.000 --> 27:36.600
Please help yourselves to the food.
Forgive me if I've been a poor host

27:43.600 --> 27:45.600
Where's my mother?

27:46.000 --> 27:49.600
We asked her to come for the
opening ceremony but she refused

27:49.600 --> 27:51.600
She even stayed in her room and cried

27:55.000 --> 27:57.000
Peng Datou?
Come over

28:00.880 --> 28:01.880
Go

28:06.000 --> 28:08.000
Why are you drinking here?

28:08.000 --> 28:11.600
I have nothing more to do with
your mother. Don't beat me!

28:12.000 --> 28:16.000
I didn't come to beat you
but to talk reason with you

28:16.000 --> 28:18.000
Talk reason?

28:19.000 --> 28:23.600
Here you are drinking alone
while my mother is crying at home

28:23.600 --> 28:25.600
What's the point?

28:26.000 --> 28:30.000
She said she asks for nothing now
so long as you're happy

28:30.000 --> 28:33.000
If I stick with her,
will you be pleased?

28:33.000 --> 28:39.000
Relax, I know my mother inside out.
She needs you very much actually

28:40.000 --> 28:46.000
And I intend to make you the chief
armed escort agent of my agency

28:49.000 --> 28:51.000
You approve of us now?

28:51.800 --> 28:53.800
Of course

28:57.000 --> 28:59.000
Don't go away

28:59.000 --> 29:01.000
Get down!

29:02.000 --> 29:05.000
From now on, you mustn't fight anymore

29:06.000 --> 29:10.600
Are you sick?
You used to disapprove of Datou

29:11.000 --> 29:15.000
That was because
you never went through the rite

29:15.000 --> 29:19.000
-Are you willing to marry my mother?
-Yes, yes!

29:19.600 --> 29:22.600
-But I don't have any bride price
-I do

29:23.000 --> 29:26.000
-Are you willing to marry him?
-Sure, sure!

29:26.000 --> 29:29.800
-But I don't have any dowry
-I do

29:31.000 --> 29:33.000
Your relationship is proper now

29:34.000 --> 29:35.600
Let's go home!

29:37.000 --> 29:40.000
What about you and Shuangxi?

29:41.000 --> 29:46.000
Don't worry. Given my eloquence,
she'll be appeased in no time

29:46.000 --> 29:48.000
Let's go home!

29:50.000 --> 29:56.800
You must be busy with state affairs.
What brings you here today?

29:58.000 --> 30:05.000
Frankly, I came to seek
your advice on something

30:06.000 --> 30:11.800
Please speak your mind.
I'm willing to share your worry

30:13.800 --> 30:19.800
Tell me, Reverend.
Is life nothing but misery?

30:20.000 --> 30:22.000
What makes you say that?

30:22.000 --> 30:25.000
When I failed my exams,
I was miserable

30:25.000 --> 30:28.000
Now that I'm the top scholar,
I'm still miserable

30:29.000 --> 30:32.600
When I couldn't be with Her Highness,
I was miserable

30:32.600 --> 30:35.000
Now that I can, I'm still miserable

30:35.800 --> 30:41.000
Isn't life full of misery?

30:43.000 --> 30:47.600
Please tell me how I can stay away
from misery and be happy

30:48.000 --> 30:54.000
In my opinion, before you held
any position, your life was carefree

30:54.000 --> 30:58.000
Now that you're an official,
you enjoy speaking up for the people

30:58.000 --> 31:03.600
Before Her Highness fancied you,
you wrote poems to entertain yourself

31:04.000 --> 31:08.000
After you marry her,
you'll live in bliss

31:09.000 --> 31:11.600
Is life full of misery at all?

31:12.000 --> 31:15.000
As for the hardships you suffer,

31:15.000 --> 31:20.000
they're meant to temper you
and make you strong

31:20.000 --> 31:24.000
You're to bring prosperity to people

31:25.000 --> 31:28.000
Bring prosperity to people?

31:28.000 --> 31:33.000
When you were an unsuccessful candidate,
you were able to enjoy life

31:33.000 --> 31:37.600
Yet now that you're a high-ranking
official, you're fretting

31:38.000 --> 31:42.000
That shows it's nothing to be
happy about when you gain something,

31:42.000 --> 31:46.000
and it's nothing to fret about
whne you lose something either

31:46.000 --> 31:48.000
You mean...?

31:49.000 --> 31:51.000
Leave it all to fate

31:51.000 --> 31:56.000
Take it when it comes your way,
and let go when it's gone

31:57.000 --> 32:02.600
You'll be free from all worries then

32:03.000 --> 32:05.600
Amitabha

32:05.600 --> 32:07.600
Please excuse me

32:20.000 --> 32:22.600
Isn't this the Palace?
Why did we come here?

32:23.000 --> 32:28.000
Lord Erlang will never dream
we'd have the guts to hide here

32:28.000 --> 32:32.000
You're right.
Let's stay here for the time being

32:34.000 --> 32:36.000
What's the matter?

32:36.600 --> 32:40.000
This place may be safe, but we can
only be together for the time being

32:41.000 --> 32:45.600
Heaven is so cruel. Why is it that
good things never last?

32:46.000 --> 32:48.000
Let's not dwell on it anymore

32:48.000 --> 32:52.800
There are many challenges ahead of us.
Let's just be happy while we can

32:53.000 --> 32:58.600
It'll be my 30th birthday
in a few days. If anything...

32:59.000 --> 33:04.000
Let's just enjoy ourselves
these few days

33:05.000 --> 33:11.000
All right. Who knows, things might
turn out for the better later

33:47.000 --> 33:52.600
Your Highness, it's true that
I'm an immortal

33:53.000 --> 33:57.600
It's not an excuse I made up
to leave you

33:59.000 --> 34:01.000
Agree to the marriage proposal then

34:03.000 --> 34:09.600
Listen to me. I feel a couple shouldn't
keep anything from each other

34:10.800 --> 34:14.800
Fine, you're an immortal. Can't you
go against the arrangement for my sake?

34:22.000 --> 34:27.000
Yes, I can. Being an immortal
is no big deal actually

34:28.000 --> 34:35.000
I'm a human at the moment.
I just want to be an ordinary man -

34:36.000 --> 34:38.000
one who's happy,

34:42.000 --> 34:44.000
and is able to be with his beloved

34:44.000 --> 34:47.000
This is what I mean by being ordinary

35:01.000 --> 35:04.600
Your Highness, we've...

35:07.000 --> 35:10.800
We've wasted too much time

35:11.000 --> 35:14.000
I'll do anything for you

35:18.000 --> 35:23.000
For your sake, I'll even
go to the extent of...

35:27.000 --> 35:30.000
giving up my chance to be an immortal

35:33.000 --> 35:38.600
Are you really willing to give it up
for my sake?

36:13.800 --> 36:16.800
Shou, look!

36:17.000 --> 36:22.600
It's food from the imperial kitchen.
We get to eat what the Emperor eats

36:23.000 --> 36:25.000
You must be hungry.
Have some

36:27.000 --> 36:29.000
It's delicious!

36:29.000 --> 36:34.000
Trust you to be such a glutton!
Is it enough? I'll go and get some more

36:34.000 --> 36:38.000
No. I'm content
just to have you by my side

36:38.000 --> 36:42.600
I must make the most
of the time we have together

36:43.600 --> 36:45.600
I'm a happy man

37:15.000 --> 37:21.600
Heaven and Earth combine as one!
I'm the supreme ruler!

37:29.000 --> 37:32.800
The nine planets have formed an arc!
Heaven is on my side!

37:35.000 --> 37:41.000
Three Stars, you subdued my Nian.
Have a taste of my new pet!

37:43.000 --> 37:46.000
So many fireflies.
How beautiful!

37:47.000 --> 37:52.600
It's glittering everywhere. Don't you
feel as if we were in the Milky Way?

37:53.000 --> 37:56.000
I don't know
what the Milky Way is like

37:56.000 --> 38:01.000
Anyway, I don't mind where I am
so long as I'm with you

38:03.000 --> 38:09.000
It's a man's good fortune
to be able to marry a woman like you

38:10.000 --> 38:12.600
You're teasing me again

38:13.000 --> 38:18.000
I'm not. You make me feel
I'm the luckiest man in the world

38:19.000 --> 38:21.000
I'm really grateful to you

38:22.000 --> 38:26.600
These fireflies may be beautiful,
but their lives are short

38:26.600 --> 38:31.000
I hope our happiness won't be
as shortlived

38:31.000 --> 38:36.600
I've made up my mind, Shuangxi.
I don't want to be an immortal

38:36.600 --> 38:38.600
I must stay in the mortal world

38:38.600 --> 38:41.600
Isn't that too big a sacrifice?

38:41.600 --> 38:46.600
It's not a sacrifice at all.
Zhang Guolao said I'm the Fortune Star

38:47.000 --> 38:53.000
But I'm the luckiest man in the world
now. What do I want to go to Heaven for?

38:59.000 --> 39:03.000
Why have the fireflies disappeared?
What's going on?

39:03.000 --> 39:05.000
Where have all of them gone?

39:32.000 --> 39:34.600
Why did the sky turn so red?

39:34.800 --> 39:36.800
-It's the Deity of Plague
-Deity of Plague?

39:37.000 --> 39:41.000
He's let the Spider Spirit out.
A disaster has befallen earth

39:41.000 --> 39:44.000
The Spider Spirit has sucked up
all the water

39:45.000 --> 39:47.000
Is there any way to subdue to it?

39:50.000 --> 39:53.000
Shou, though I'm happy with you,

39:53.000 --> 39:57.800
we mustn't hide here like cowards
and fend only for ourselves anymore

40:00.000 --> 40:06.000
The people are in trouble.
We mustn't just think of ourselves

40:07.000 --> 40:11.000
Even as humans,
our conscience will be bugging at us

40:12.000 --> 40:14.000
Right.
Let's go

41:05.000 --> 41:10.000
Mother!
Where are you? Mother!

41:12.000 --> 41:14.800
A spider!
Help!

41:33.000 --> 41:35.000
Where's Jiujin?

41:36.000 --> 41:38.000
Mother!

41:49.800 --> 41:51.800
Mother!

42:06.000 --> 42:08.000
Shou, it's Lord Erlang!

42:22.800 --> 42:23.800
Stop there!

42:26.000 --> 42:27.000
Ma Ruyi!

42:29.000 --> 42:31.000
There's no way you can escape!

42:35.000 --> 42:38.000
How dare you come to the mortal world!
Go back with me!

42:38.000 --> 42:42.000
Do you know the Deity of Plague has
let the Spider Spirit out to wreak havoc?

42:42.000 --> 42:46.000
Instead of subduing it, you came
after Ma-gu. You're too much!

42:46.600 --> 42:49.600
Cut that out!
Ma-gu, leave with me now!

42:49.600 --> 42:51.000
Listen to me, Erlang!

42:52.000 --> 42:56.000
Ma-gu came down to the mortal world
because I asked her to

42:56.000 --> 42:59.000
She isn't to blame.
Please let her off!

43:01.000 --> 43:03.000
Please, I beg you!

43:04.000 --> 43:07.000
Please have mercy on us

43:08.000 --> 43:13.000
I give you my word that once
Fu, Lu, Ma-gu and I have subdued...

43:13.000 --> 43:18.000
the Spider Spirit and Deity of Plague,
we'll go to Heaven to receive punishment

43:18.000 --> 43:20.000
Please believe us just this once!

43:20.000 --> 43:24.600
You have to go through three disasters
and six tribulations to become immortals

43:25.000 --> 43:30.800
So it shouldn't be Ma-gu's concern
to subdue the Spider Spirit at all

43:31.000 --> 43:34.000
Don't be so stubborn!

43:34.000 --> 43:38.000
No more nonsense! You're not fit
to talk terms with me yet!

43:38.000 --> 43:40.000
Wait till you've become an immortal!

43:40.000 --> 43:42.000
Ma-gu, go!

43:49.000 --> 43:53.000
I'll leave with you! He's a mortal
after all. Don't be difficult with him

43:53.000 --> 43:55.000
Run, Ruyi!

43:55.000 --> 43:57.000
You must accept this, Shou

43:57.000 --> 43:59.000
I said run!
Don't bother about me!

43:59.000 --> 44:03.000
Find Fu and Lu and see how you can
subdue the Spider Spirit

44:03.000 --> 44:08.000
I'm sure once you're back in place,
there will be peace again

44:09.000 --> 44:13.000
Remember - you're sacrificing
yourselves for the mortals, not for me

44:13.600 --> 44:14.600
No!

44:14.600 --> 44:15.600
Go!

44:17.000 --> 44:19.800
Ruyi!

44:20.000 --> 44:24.000
Ruyi...!

44:30.000 --> 44:31.000
Mother!

44:33.000 --> 44:35.000
Mother...!

44:36.000 --> 44:38.000
Subtitled by S Lin
